+#ifdef TERTIUS_PRECISE_SPECULAR_HISTORY
+// SCRATCH (t0-5tyj, experiment XD, never commit to src): own rays wait while light evidence holds the block's histories.
+// The spatial dispatch cuts every history of an 8 x 8 block with light evidence to fastCap, so such a history cannot grow
+// and its own rays buy nothing. This draw's evidence is not known yet, so the plan derives it from the last draw's sample
+// ages (the same blocks: both dispatches run 8 x 8 workgroups over the pixels): a light code ages by one per draw, so a
+// last code c that is still recent as c + 1 is this draw's light evidence. Bit 1 holds the reflection, bit 2 the diffuse.
+// A real build keeps the predicate in sample_age.glsl beside recentLightCode.
+shared uint heldKinds;
+
+bool lightEvidencePending(uint lastSampleAge)
+{
+    uint lastCode = lightCodeOf(lastSampleAge);
+    return lastCode != 0u && recentLightCode(lastCode + 1u);
+}
+#endif
